      "instance_name": "Anderson_Cooper",
      "label": "Anderson Cooper",
      "description": "A well-known American news anchor and television personality for CNN, recognized for his serious, professional demeanor and coverage of major news events. His image is used here to satirize the perceived disconnect between media presentation and public perception.",
