      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "media_credibility",
      "label": "Media Credibility",
      "description": "The perceived reliability, accuracy, and trustworthiness of news sources. The meme critiques the notion that media narratives are no longer seen as credible by the general public, a concept central to understanding the meme’s message.",
